icinga2-splunk (2.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Only HTTP 2xx from Splunk HEC counts as delivered; redirects are kept
    and retried instead of being silently dropped.
  * Disk spool writes are all-or-nothing; disk errors in the spool are
    logged instead of stopping delivery or shutdown.
  * Idle event stream timeouts reconnect immediately and log at INFO.
  * Reject embedded URL credentials, blank CA paths and non-finite numbers
    in the configuration; limit event lines to 10 MiB.
  * Fix busy loop during Splunk outages without a disk spool.
  * Use adduser --comment where available.

 -- Jostein Elvaker Haande <jehaande@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0100

